cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this data set, please cite it as below. To cite a specific
  version, use the DOI of that release on Zenodo.
type: dataset
title: >-
  Gunnerus Open Data Set: drawings, 3D model and metadata of the
  research vessel R/V Gunnerus
abstract: >-
  Production drawings (DWG, DXF and A0 PDF), a 3D CAD model, engineering
  documents and structured metadata for the NTNU research vessel R/V
  Gunnerus, published openly as a reference ship case for research,
  teaching, benchmarking and the development of digital shipbuilding tools.
  Drawings and design data courtesy of polarkonsult; derivative drawings,
  3D model and engineering documents by C-JOB and NTNU; published by NTNU.
